The  device  driver  provides an interface for Windows Management
Instrumentation The interface is typically used to support vendor
specific features found in various laptops.  The  following  map‐
pings  are  supported:  Dell  laptops  Some models of Asus Eee PC
Hewlett‐Packard laptops MSI laptops The functionality varies from
vendor to vendor.  Typically the interface is used  for  function
and hotkey handling, but additional features may be present.  The
device  driver appeared in wrote and most of the mappings.  While
